    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/4706a0b34ed44a440e24a1e8dee388a1.avif?t=1749422468\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the role of highschool student <i>Kimino</i></strong>\u00a0as she sneaks into her school at night, only to find it transformed into an impossibly vast space that mimics her greatest fears. Carefully navigate this nightmare to learn more about Kimino and help her find happiness through love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/c7d8e81e4e9779ddbd0cb8c7d36579d7.avif?t=1749422468\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locate mysteriously-placed objects</strong> that may serve Kimino to overcome her fears and find her way safely through unfamiliar surroundings. Investigation is key, however, it is best not to overstay your welcome...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/4a7d8bef2b946eeb58c7c7e5406b6992.avif?t=1749422468\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not alone</strong>\u00a0in these winding halls, and means of self-defense are limited. Careful observation, intent listening, and efficiency in planning your path are necessary to make it from one point of safety to another.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/e13f8ea015ed81995329b0b736fdd69f.avif?t=1749422468\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communicate with specters that share your likeness</strong> to<strong>\u00a0</strong>learn more and unravel Kimino's psyche. It is the only way to attain happiness and leave this nightmare.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/4706a0b34ed44a440e24a1e8dee388a1.avif?t=1749422468\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the role of highschool student <i>Kimino</i></strong>\u00a0as she sneaks into her school at night, only to find it transformed into an impossibly vast space that mimics her greatest fears. Carefully navigate this nightmare to learn more about Kimino and help her find happiness through love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/c7d8e81e4e9779ddbd0cb8c7d36579d7.avif?t=1749422468\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locate mysteriously-placed objects</strong> that may serve Kimino to overcome her fears and find her way safely through unfamiliar surroundings. Investigation is key, however, it is best not to overstay your welcome...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/4a7d8bef2b946eeb58c7c7e5406b6992.avif?t=1749422468\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not alone</strong>\u00a0in these winding halls, and means of self-defense are limited. Careful observation, intent listening, and efficiency in planning your path are necessary to make it from one point of safety to another.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680110/extras/e13f8ea015ed81995329b0b736fdd69f.avif?t=1749422468\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communicate with specters that share your likeness</strong> to<strong>\u00a0</strong>learn more and unravel Kimino's psyche. It is the only way to attain happiness and leave this nightmare.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
